[CR CR5697 for 38.133] CR to 38.133 on corrections to performance requirement for carrier phase measurements for positioning Clauses affected: 10.1.43.1 START OF CHANGE # 1 10.1.43 DL-RSCPD Measurements 10.1.43.1 Introduction The requirements in clause 10.1.43 shall apply, provided the UE has received NR-DL-TDOA-RequestLocationInformation message with dl-PRS-RSCPD-Request-r18[DEL]nr-DL-PRS-RSCPD-Request[/DEL] from LMF via LPP TS 37.355 [34] requesting the UE to measure and report DL RSCPD measurement together with DL RSTD measurements defined in TS 38.215 [4]. The requirements in clause 10.1.43 shall apply: - when UE is in RRC_CONNECTED state and the measurement is performed with MG, - when UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE state. END OF CHANGE # 1 START OF CHANGE # 2 10.1.44 DL-RSCP Measurements 10.1.44.1 Introduction The requirements in clause 10.1.44 shall apply, provided the UE has received NR-Multi-RTT-RequestLocationInformation message with dl-PRS-RSCP-Request-r18[DEL]nr-DL-PRS-RSCP-Request[/DEL] from LMF via LPP TS 37.355 [34] requesting the UE to measure and report DL RSCP measurement together with UE Rx-Tx time difference measurements defined in TS 38.215 [4]. The requirements in clause 10.1.44 shall apply: - when UE is in RRC_CONNECTED state and the measurement is performed with MG, - when UE is in RRC_INACTIVE state. END OF CHANGE # 2
